      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but i think it's a little too... plain? like, it's missing that emotional \"punch\" we need for a big rally crowd. \n\ni checked it against the internal tool and the inspiration score came back pretty low—probably around 4 or 5. the analytics guys are going to say it's too \"matter-of-fact\" and won't stir up the emotions needed to get people moving.\n\ncan you try a second version? try to ramp up the descriptive language and the emotional resonance so that score moves up more significantly. just, again, please keep it sounding like a person actually talking. don't just throw adjectives in for the sake of it, but make it feel much more vivid and powerful.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
